From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 11:28:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] feat: staff can create percentage-off discount codes

Adds the discount_codes table (migration 008), the DiscountCode model,
and DiscountCodeService.create, which normalises the code to upper case,
validates it, and records discount_code.created in the audit log.

clock.today() gives the UK date, which is what an expiry date means.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
